ipm ─ search: type to search                                                                                    ● hybrid
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Search mode                                                 Tree mode                                                   
                                                                                                                        
typing        search (results refresh as you type)          ↑ ↓  k j      siblings and 'also in' rows                   
↓ / tab       from the search box: focus the results        ← →  h l      parent / first child                          
/             focus the search box                          enter         on an 'also in' row: follow it                
↑ ↓  j k      move through results; the tree follows        a / d         add / remove the node                         
← →  h l      move the tree to the parent / first child     tab / esc     back to search mode                           
tab / enter   tree mode                                                                                                 
a / d         add / remove the selected result                                                                          
t             the pack tray (d removes, esc back)                                                                       
f             cycle the type filter                                                                                     
p             switch pack, or n for a new one                                                                           
b / i         build every pack (ipm install)                                                                            
D             deploy the active pack to Claude Code                                                                     
ctrl+r        check the search server again                                                                             
?             this help                                                                                                 
q  ctrl+c     quit                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                        
esc or ? closes this                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
